      "anchor": {
        "section": "Polaris has not always been the North Star"
      },
      "note": "Precession slowly changes which star lies near the celestial pole. This is the source-backed limit on carrying a modern star alignment into another historical epoch.",
      "review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
